=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 years, more than any other pair, and in 2025 it ran 41% of normal. August to September 2025 was not much better at 46%. Grid 22061 had its driest year in 1953 at 55% of normal.</p>"}
